# Testing Philosophy

Every subsystem should support:

- Unit Tests
- Integration Tests
- Stress Tests
- Performance Benchmarks
- Regression Tests

The runtime should be testable without the editor.

---

# Documentation Philosophy

Every subsystem should include:

- Purpose
- Responsibilities
- Public API
- Data Flow
- Threading Model
- Performance Notes
- Known Limitations

Documentation evolves with the code.

---

# Development Workflow

```
Architecture

↓

Interfaces

↓

Implementation

↓

Compilation

↓

Testing

↓

Profiling

↓

Optimization

↓

Documentation
```

No subsystem skips architecture.

---

# Long-Term Roadmap

```
D001  Architecture Foundation
    ✓ Complete

D002  Core Framework
    ✓ Complete

D003  Asset System
    ✓ Complete

D004  Memory System

D005  Event System

D006  Math Library

D007  Runtime Framework
    In Progress

D008  Rendering Foundation

