The UI subsystem consists of:

```text
UIService

UIManager

WidgetSystem

LayoutEngine

StyleManager

ThemeManager

AnimationController

InputRouter

LocalizationAdapter

DataBinding

HUDManager

MenuManager
```

Each module performs a single responsibility.

---

# 4. Runtime UI vs Editor UI

Echo Engine distinguishes between two independent UI systems.

```text
Runtime UI

Player Interface

----------------

Editor UI

Developer Interface
```

Although both may share rendering technology, they remain architecturally separate.

The game never depends on editor widgets.

---

