# 10. Input Routing

The Input Router determines where input should be delivered.

Priority example:

```text id="ztpt4x"
UI

↓

Gameplay

↓

Debug Tools
```

If the UI consumes an input event, gameplay does not receive it.

---

# 11. Event Processing

The Input System converts hardware activity into engine events.

Example:

```text id="9zjlwm"
Key Press

↓

Input Event

↓

Action Event

↓

Gameplay
```

The EventBus distributes input notifications without direct subsystem coupling.

