CyberTree03.glb
Footstep_Concrete_01.wav
Walk_Animation_01.fbx
```

The engine stores and displays compact internal identifiers:

| Asset Type | Prefix | Example |
|------------|--------|---------|
| Texture | TX | `TX001` |
| Model | MD | `MD034` |
| Material | MT | `MT091` |
| Shader | SH | `SH022` |
| Animation | AN | `AN044` |
| Audio | AU | `AU017` |
| Level | LV | `LV005` |
| Scene | SC | `SC011` |
| Prefab | PR | `PR003` |
| Font | FT | `FT008` |
| Video | VD | `VD002` |
| Particle | PT | `PT019` |

#### 4.1 Asset Registry

The Asset Registry maintains the mapping between internal IDs and source filenames:

```text
