### 11. Implementation Phases

#### Phase 1: Core Matrix (Current)
- ⬜ PlayerSpatialMatrix class
- ⬜ Distance and angle calculations
- ⬜ Sector/cell caching
- ⬜ Basic raycasting

#### Phase 2: Visibility (Next)
